#: game/cmbatai2.msg:32443 game/combatai.msg:32443
msgid "I love the smell of blood in the morning..."
msgstr "Adoro l'odore di sangue al mattino..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:32444 game/combatai.msg:32444
