msgstr "Dai, vieni! Ti stuprero'!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:32524 game/cmbatai2.msg:32544 game/combatai.msg:32524
#: game/combatai.msg:32544
msgid "You are SO dead."
msgstr "Sei COSI' morto."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:32525 game/combatai.msg:32525
