#: game/cmbatai2.msg:32542 game/combatai.msg:32542
msgid "Iii... will always love YOOUUUUU"
msgstr "Iooo... ti amero' per SEMPREEEE"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:32545 game/combatai.msg:32545
