msgid "Murder Carlson in NCR."
msgstr "Ammazza Carlson a NCR."

#: game/quests.msg:814
msgid "Deliver ten Cat's Paw magazines to Miss Kitty."
msgstr "Consegna dieci riviste Cat's Paw a Miss Kitty."

